{"id":892,"slug":"892-flatten-nested-array-khong-dung-array-flat","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Coding Challenge","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Flatten nested array (không dùng Array.flat)?","question_en":"Flatten a nested array (without using Array.flat).","answer_vi":"Flatten nested array bằng đệ quy reduce hoặc iterative spread.\n\n```js\n// Recursive\nfunction flatten(arr) {\n  return arr.reduce((acc, item) =>\n    acc.concat(Array.isArray(item) ? flatten(item) : item), []);\n}\n// Iterative\nwhile (arr.some(Array.isArray)) arr = [].concat(...arr);\n```\n\nPhỏng vấn thường hỏi để test hiểu recursion và Array methods.","answer_en":"Flatten a nested array either recursively with reduce, or iteratively with spread.\n\n```js\n// Recursive\nfunction flatten(arr) {\n  return arr.reduce((acc, item) =>\n    acc.concat(Array.isArray(item) ? flatten(item) : item), []);\n}\n// Iterative\nwhile (arr.some(Array.isArray)) arr = [].concat(...arr);\n```\n\nInterviewers ask this to test recursion and knowledge of array methods.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Flatten nested array bằng đệ quy reduce hoặc iterative spread.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// Recursive\nfunction flatten(arr) {\n  return arr.reduce((acc, item) =&gt;\n    acc.concat(Array.isArray(item) ? flatten(item) : item), []);\n}\n// Iterative\nwhile (arr.some(Array.isArray)) arr = [].concat(...arr);\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Recursive</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">flatten</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">arr</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> arr.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduce</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">acc, item</span>) =&gt;</span>\n    acc.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">concat</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isArray</span>(item) ? <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">flatten</span>(item) : item), []);\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Iterative</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (arr.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">some</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">isArray</span>)) arr = [].<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">concat</span>(...arr);</code></pre></div><p>Phỏng vấn thường hỏi để test hiểu recursion và Array methods.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Flatten a nested array either recursively with reduce, or iteratively with spread.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// Recursive\nfunction flatten(arr) {\n  return arr.reduce((acc, item) =&gt;\n    acc.concat(Array.isArray(item) ? flatten(item) : item), []);\n}\n// Iterative\nwhile (arr.some(Array.isArray)) arr = [].concat(...arr);\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Recursive</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">flatten</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">arr</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> arr.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduce</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">acc, item</span>) =&gt;</span>\n    acc.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">concat</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isArray</span>(item) ? <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">flatten</span>(item) : item), []);\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Iterative</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (arr.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">some</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">isArray</span>)) arr = [].<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">concat</span>(...arr);</code></pre></div><p>Interviewers ask this to test recursion and knowledge of array methods.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol tro